<title>UK: LME copper ends steady ahead of long U.K. weekend.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends steady ahead of long U.K. weekend.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Finishes kerb unchanged at $2,360. Cash/threes narrow some $5 to around $70.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Also ends $4 lower at $1,624.</p>
<p>NICKEL/TIN - Settle firmer. LEAD/ZINC - Softer. London market closed until May 6.</p>
</text>
